WEBVTT

00:01:49.190 --> 00:01:50.110
I'm going home.

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:51.390
What's wrong?

00:01:51.390 --> 00:01:52.350
I'll give you a lift.

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:56.900
Give a lift to that brother of yours instead.

00:01:57.330 --> 00:01:58.510
I'm fine.

00:01:59.110 --> 00:02:01.740
Aren't you hurt, Hoshimura-san?

00:02:02.170 --> 00:02:03.420
I've recovered already.

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:05.760
I'm a Corpse you know.

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:09.490
Tell him about me.

00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:15.160
Bro.

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:17.160
She's not the type that listens to what people say.

00:02:17.560 --> 00:02:19.570
Women like her aren't easy.

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:21.810
What the hell are you saying?

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:35.590
There's nothing in here.

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:41.590
So you're really going to explain everything, right?

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:45.540
Don't take things without asking.

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:49.100
I could explain it to you...

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:51.250
but it will cost you.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:56.680
One thousand... two thousand... ten thousand...

00:02:56.920 --> 00:02:57.710
Huh?

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:00.150
I've been through a lot of trouble...

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:01.830
...to find out what her measurements are.

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:04.460
You mean Hoshimura-san’s ones?

00:03:09.310 --> 00:03:11.550
No, I’m not talking about Makina.

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:13.920
Anyway, that’s not what I want to know.

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:15.670
Stop kidding me and just explain!

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:22.890
You want to know why Makina and I fight, right?

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:30.370
You know, Oori.

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:41.710
Did you ever wonder what happens after you die?

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:46.850
There is meaning to every person's death.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:50.600
All deaths have some kind of influence to us and our society...

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:53.540
...and then change a part in this world.

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:57.260
Death is never something that should be hated and avoided.

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:00.990
Yeah, but...

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:01.980
Yes.

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:04.410
There are some that think 'but'.

00:04:06.190 --> 00:04:11.400
Those that don't believe their deaths have a meaning, don't accept the cause...

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:16.580
...those who are obsessively attached to this world, become those monsters we call Corpses.

00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:20.270
Why?

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:22.280
Why does that happen...

00:04:22.510 --> 00:04:25.510
We have done much research to find out those reasons.

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:27.390
But we haven't found any answers.

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:36.320
The main purpose of Kougon-cult is to save all the living things from their pangs of death.

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:41.160
In other words, we have to revert the corpses to what they should be and keep world peace.

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:43.730
Do you understand it now, Oori?

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:48.710
This is our job.

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:51.050
You have nothing to do with it.

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:56.980
Wait up, bro.

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:02.060
So you didn't fall from your bike all those times you got home wounded?

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:03.640
Well.

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:06.380
Sometimes I really fall from it.

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:08.250
Then it's normal that I worry about you.

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:10.500
Don't tell me that it has nothing to do with me!

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:15.340
Bro, if you ever get wounded badly and you...

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:20.450
Then please light up a candle for me.

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:23.090
What will happen to the Dairinkan if you die?!

00:05:24.770 --> 00:05:25.950
Those kids...

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:30.200
What should all of us who are left behind do?

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:32.310
I'm sorry, Oori.

00:05:33.010 --> 00:05:34.590
I can't quit.

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:38.480
Makina is the only reason why I am a Contracted Priest.

00:05:40.780 --> 00:05:43.120
I'm the only one she can rely on.

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:01.810
Is this it?

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:03.030
It must be it.

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:04.280
We're in luck.

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:06.100
It's just like a new one.

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:07.550
What are you thinking?

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:09.060
Whose car is this?

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:11.060
No ones.

00:06:12.820 --> 00:06:14.400
Come, get in.

00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:16.180
Just like I heard.

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:17.530
The key is still there.

00:06:20.140 --> 00:06:21.260
I just told you.

00:06:21.260 --> 00:06:26.860
I heard that it's from some kind of rent-a-car company that's renting cars unlicensed.

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:28.150
Rental cars?

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:30.150
So do we have to pay for this?

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:33.220
They said I should put the cash in the dashboard when we're finished.

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:35.130
But I'm not that stupid.

00:06:35.730 --> 00:06:38.560
So isn't it better to steal with this car?

00:06:38.760 --> 00:06:42.090
The rumor says that if you don't give it back properly, you..

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:46.240
No.

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:47.030
What was that?

00:06:47.230 --> 00:06:47.950
Stop.

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:49.370
Stop it.

00:06:53.920 --> 00:06:54.510
What?

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:56.260
This is a joke, right?

00:07:25.260 --> 00:07:27.170
Our dear Kun-chan is dead.

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:28.460
Why?!

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:29.880
She was a goddess.

00:07:30.240 --> 00:07:34.950
I can't believe she pushed herself yesterday to give a concert.

00:07:35.310 --> 00:07:38.150
She really thought of her fans.

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:41.440
But, she was connected somehow to the Yakuza.

00:07:41.970 --> 00:07:43.720
Don’t soil Kun-chan’s name!

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:44.480
Oori!

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:46.480
You should mourn too!

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:48.790
Yeah, yeah.

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:51.230
You must be tired after doing your paper round this morning.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:11.140
Today, we'll be having a newly transferred student join us.

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:12.430
She's cute!

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:13.380
Unbelievable.

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:14.110
Marry me!

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:17.630
Her name is Yamagami Itsuki.

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:22.280
Oori, it's a miracle!

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:24.280
An angel has come to our class!

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:26.280
Have you already forgotten about Osaki-kun?

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:27.360
Hi!

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:28.740
Look over here!

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:41.200
Oori!

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:42.980
You bastard.

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:44.430
When did you...

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:53.790
Uh...

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:55.700
You're Kagami Oori-kun, right?

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:56.850
Yeah...

00:08:57.020 --> 00:08:58.170
I'm sorry about earlier.

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:00.970
I thought you resembled my dog from the time I was a child.

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:02.420
So I waved at you accidentally.

00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:03.050
Eh?

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:04.760
A dog?

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:06.970
But this must be some kind of connection.

00:09:07.470 --> 00:09:08.690
So let's become friends.

00:09:14.260 --> 00:09:15.180
Okay.

00:09:17.980 --> 00:09:21.040
What's wrong with Oori being friends with her?

00:09:21.280 --> 00:09:22.590
I won't forgive him.

00:09:22.920 --> 00:09:27.570
I will never forgive the fact that a girl smiled at him before me.

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:28.820
Listen.

00:09:29.120 --> 00:09:35.250
I’m sure Yamagami-san will be the one who can make up for the lack of enormous breasts in our class.

00:09:35.450 --> 00:09:36.630
He's so cool.

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:37.990
Wonderful!

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:40.230
What's the matter, my honeys?

00:09:43.190 --> 00:09:46.750
They said there was a new P.E. teacher.

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:49.950
A handsome one...

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:51.000
Probably.

00:09:51.010 --> 00:09:52.220
Note: Sign means "Spiritual Territory."

00:10:07.650 --> 00:10:09.460
Well, this is about what I can do.

00:10:09.690 --> 00:10:13.090
I might not be able to teach you much,

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:14.730
but I'm looking forward to be working with you guys.

00:10:20.070 --> 00:10:23.630
Do you mean the position as leader will be taken away from me?

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:28.080
The bishop didn't say anything like that.

00:10:28.680 --> 00:10:32.140
You must know why I adopted Oori.

00:10:32.140 --> 00:10:33.290
But...

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:40.610
You must understand that the truth about Contract Priests mustn't be revealed to your brother no matter what.

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:43.800
That was the deal I believe, Keisei.

00:10:44.230 --> 00:10:45.250
Dad...

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:49.670
You must obey the rules and dispose of Kagami Oori.

00:10:49.900 --> 00:10:50.790
Is that clear?

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:54.380
Until that's dealt with, you are suspended from your job.

00:10:59.030 --> 00:11:01.270
Thank you so much.

00:11:01.440 --> 00:11:07.960
Is it you who reported this case to the great bishop Gon, Inspector Honda?

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:11.290
That is what I am here for.

00:11:11.490 --> 00:11:14.490
Can't you trust Oori at all?

00:11:14.780 --> 00:11:15.770
Even now?

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:17.620
We must doubt everything.

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:20.320
That is what we inspectors do.

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:21.610
In my humble opinion.

00:11:22.300 --> 00:11:28.100
The young Tagami tends to bond with that Shikabane Hime as a human being.

00:11:28.760 --> 00:11:33.440
It’s because she is Hoshimura’s daughter.

00:11:33.930 --> 00:11:37.820
Bonding or considering them as human beings is against the teachings.

00:11:41.740 --> 00:11:42.700
But...

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:48.100
I hope that there won't be any Corpses appearing in that area, while Keisei is off the job.

00:11:48.630 --> 00:11:50.100
I shall go.

00:11:50.510 --> 00:11:52.390
That area is one of the home territories of the head temple.

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:57.140
We can't let our strongest Shikabane Hime get hurt.

00:11:57.270 --> 00:12:01.290
Don’t worry, Kamika-sama. Genpaku is already in the area.

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:02.540
I see.

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:04.390
I did hear rumors about them.

00:12:04.390 --> 00:12:05.310
But...

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:06.960
Nineteen years old.

00:12:07.320 --> 00:12:10.940
When he was nineteen years old, he has joined us as the youngest Contracted Priest.

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:21.190
What do you think, bishop?

00:12:21.520 --> 00:12:26.040
Contracted Priests aren't allowed to reveal their job to their families.

00:12:26.530 --> 00:12:31.540
It’s better that no one knows of the Shikabane Himes.

00:12:32.830 --> 00:12:34.480
But I feel that there is more than meets the eye.

00:12:35.140 --> 00:12:36.480
I think so too.

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:39.650
There is also the issue that Keisei could be a betrayer priest.

00:12:40.670 --> 00:12:43.470
We already investigated that matter.

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:46.610
The one about the unlicensed rental cars.

00:12:47.330 --> 00:12:49.040
It turned out that no company is renting them out.

00:12:49.840 --> 00:12:53.400
And none of the renters have come back alive.

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:55.700
Could it be the trap of a Corpse?

00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:57.700
Be we were ordered not to make any actions.

00:12:58.570 --> 00:13:03.580
Isn't it our job to prevent any human being turned into a Corpse?

00:13:04.110 --> 00:13:06.610
We have betrayed the teachings by telling Oori about you.

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:11.230
Above that, they suspect Oori of working together with the Corpses.

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:13.040
That's what they believe.

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:14.090
Why?

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:15.580
Anyway...

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:17.390
I think we can rest for the time being.

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:21.610
A drive?

00:13:21.770 --> 00:13:22.760
Yes, that's right.

00:13:23.120 --> 00:13:23.910
They asked me to go.

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:26.750
But I was afraid.

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:28.430
Of that sempai?

00:13:29.980 --> 00:13:32.980
I've heard that there's this unlicensed rental car company.

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:36.470
Won't you come with me, Kagami-kun?

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:42.140
I'm sorry.

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:44.140
I have a part time job.

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:47.910
Please.

00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:52.390
See you.

00:13:57.890 --> 00:13:59.150
Ouch!

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:00.400
Why?

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:01.850
Why?!

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:03.850
An unlicensed rental car company?

00:14:04.550 --> 00:14:05.640
I've heard about it.

00:14:06.930 --> 00:14:10.320
Rumor say that nobody has come back alive with it.

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:17.970
I wonder if he'll show up.

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:21.860
No man can ever say no to you, Itsuki.

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:26.370
Everyone except you, Takamasa.

00:14:27.390 --> 00:14:29.010
That's not true.

00:14:29.530 --> 00:14:31.010
Just be careful.

00:14:43.640 --> 00:14:44.560
Makina.

00:14:54.880 --> 00:14:57.520
An unlicensed rental car causes disappearances.

00:14:57.520 --> 00:14:59.690
This smells like the doing of a Corpse.

00:15:00.520 --> 00:15:01.370
It doesn't concern me.

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:03.510
That's what I've been told.

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:06.980
But it does concern you already.

00:15:10.600 --> 00:15:11.890
I finished putting out the trash.

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:13.010
I'm leaving.

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:24.050
I'm glad.

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:26.050
You came.

00:15:26.390 --> 00:15:28.050
You know, Yamagami-san.

00:15:28.560 --> 00:15:33.840
I heard that there is something fishy about this unlicensed rental car.

00:15:33.840 --> 00:15:34.990
What are you doing?

00:15:45.970 --> 00:15:46.820
I knew it.

00:15:48.900 --> 00:15:49.990
You know her?

00:15:50.250 --> 00:15:53.150
Let's go for a drive together then.

00:16:00.800 --> 00:16:02.440
Say, Yamagami-san.

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:06.100
You don't have a license, do you?

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:09.200
Do I drive that bad?

00:16:11.410 --> 00:16:13.120
Who is this sempai that asked you for a drive?

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:16.220
I lied.

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:19.220
Actually I just wanted to go for a drive with you, Kagami-kun.

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:19.910
Eh?

00:16:23.340 --> 00:16:26.440
But I didn't know you had a girlfriend.

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:28.050
Girlfriend?

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:30.790
Oh, was I wrong?

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:32.210
I'm glad.

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:33.030
Yeah.

00:16:33.230 --> 00:16:35.240
So go ahead and take him.

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:36.030
Hey!

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:39.190
Explain yourself.

00:16:39.980 --> 00:16:43.540
I was sure I'd meet you, since this is a strange affair.

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:45.850
I told you not to get involved.

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:49.440
But I can't help being worried about my brother.

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:57.020
Because of you, Keisei will have to stop.

00:16:57.620 --> 00:16:59.590
So please, don't show up again.

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:03.610
Brother told me he became a Contracted Priest for you.

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:07.930
Be careful, Yamagami-san.

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:09.880
Aren't you going too fast?

00:17:10.310 --> 00:17:13.170
But I'm not even touching the steering wheel anymore.

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:15.220
What about the breaks?

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:17.620
It doesn't work.

00:17:35.910 --> 00:17:36.670
Only one?

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:39.110
What is this?

00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:42.540
It means we must kill each other.

00:17:42.640 --> 00:17:43.690
Yamagami-san?

00:17:44.090 --> 00:17:45.180
But that's what it says.

00:17:45.740 --> 00:17:50.650
Kill each other, and the last one standing will get out of this car safely.

00:17:51.010 --> 00:17:52.000
Calm down.

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:53.020
No.

00:17:53.350 --> 00:17:55.520
I don't want to die.

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:57.010
No.

00:17:58.620 --> 00:18:02.310
If we kill each other like this, it will mean that we're attached to this world.

00:18:03.340 --> 00:18:06.990
And the chances of becoming a Corpse are bigger than in a normal death.

00:18:07.390 --> 00:18:09.890
So this car was meant for this from the beginning?

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:11.210
What are you talking about?

00:18:11.710 --> 00:18:14.480
There is no other way.

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:16.350
Hoshimura-san!

00:18:16.680 --> 00:18:18.330
You're cruel.

00:18:19.350 --> 00:18:21.300
Normally, humans try not to die this desperately.

00:18:21.890 --> 00:18:23.370
If you don't want to die,

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:24.530
Remember this!

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:31.650
You've got a pretty fancy disguise.

00:18:32.800 --> 00:18:34.910
But we won't be the ones killing each other.

00:18:35.370 --> 00:18:36.130
It's just...

00:18:36.690 --> 00:18:37.680
...me and you, Corpse!

00:18:56.170 --> 00:18:57.020
Hoshimura-san!

00:18:57.650 --> 00:18:58.470
You should get out too!

00:19:26.460 --> 00:19:29.720
Your friend looks scared.

00:19:33.970 --> 00:19:35.420
Can you see her?

00:19:36.010 --> 00:19:36.870
This cat?

00:19:38.020 --> 00:19:38.870
Oori.

00:19:39.410 --> 00:19:40.300
That is...

00:19:40.600 --> 00:19:41.650
There, there.

00:19:42.210 --> 00:19:44.150
You shouldn't interfere in a conversation.

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:48.140
Who are you?

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:50.220
The betrayer monk.

00:19:50.480 --> 00:19:52.060
That's what they call me.

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:54.870
Because I'm disobeying the Kougon cult.

00:19:55.100 --> 00:20:00.340
And because I'm trying to destroy all the dolls the Kougon cult created.

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:01.590
Dolls?

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:03.800
You mean the Shikabane Hime?

00:20:04.190 --> 00:20:08.380
Do you know what Shikabane Himes are?

00:20:08.710 --> 00:20:09.960
That's...

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:12.530
...a good Corpse.

00:20:14.970 --> 00:20:17.380
They defeat other Corpses for the sake of humans.

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:19.820
For that you believe they are good Corpses?

00:20:20.870 --> 00:20:22.060
I will explain it to you.

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:25.450
Shikabane Himes have a contract.

00:20:27.100 --> 00:20:29.410
If they defeat 108 Corpses,

00:20:30.730 --> 00:20:32.140
they can go to Heaven.

00:20:33.300 --> 00:20:34.750
Heaven?

00:20:36.390 --> 00:20:40.810
A Shikabane Hime isn't different from those who have become Corpses.

00:20:41.370 --> 00:20:43.550
They don't know how to die.

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:48.090
The Kougon cult uses them to...

00:20:52.970 --> 00:20:54.220
Yamagami-san!?

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:56.930
I see.

00:20:57.390 --> 00:21:00.290
You were the one that tried to make new Corpses!

00:21:00.620 --> 00:21:02.000
Making Corpses?

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:07.110
That was just the first step to my plan.

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:09.110
Whatever your objectives are,

00:21:09.810 --> 00:21:10.510
I won't forgive it!

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:20.060
Yamagami-san.

00:21:20.060 --> 00:21:20.620
Are you...

00:21:21.680 --> 00:21:23.330
Didn't you listen?

00:21:23.430 --> 00:21:29.590
She made a contract with the Kougon cult to gain a new life by killing 108 Corpses.

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:32.290
A Corpse killing Shikabane Hime.

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:46.130
Kougon cult’s Contracted Priest.

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:48.740
Sougi Takamasa...

00:21:49.860 --> 00:21:50.880
...has arrived!

00:23:26.260 --> 00:23:26.920
Come on.

00:23:27.150 --> 00:23:28.070
Run.

00:23:28.600 --> 00:23:30.970
Believe that something is waiting for you there.

00:23:31.800 --> 00:23:32.520
Come on.

00:23:32.520 --> 00:23:33.640
Run.

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:38.370
And let's find new despair when you arrive at your destination.
